'''Best of the Best Milestone Edition''' (DL記念選抜ガチャ, ''Daunrōdo Kinen Senbatsu Gacha'', '''DL Celebration Selection Gacha''') is a [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] event added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]]. It features [[Koneko (Uber Rare Cat)|Koneko]] along with selected Uber Rare units from the regular Rare Cat Capsule events in addition to all of the non-collab [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] units.

